","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-21T18:43:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-21T18:43:37Z","body":"> I was not able to reproduce the issue in either of the mrps on 4.5 beta1 or 4.6 rc1 using an Nvidia GTX 970 and driver version 580.105.08 under Linux.\n\nThat GPU lacks FP16 support, so that makes sense (it uses the slower but more precise FP32 fallback). FP16 support was added on Turing GPUs on NVIDIA.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3780548962/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]